WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.260 --> 01:38.940
=Episode 17=

01:40.420 --> 01:41.140
Chunhua!

01:42.060 --> 01:42.860
Chunhua!

01:43.820 --> 01:44.500
(Wenmo Pavilion)
Chunhua!

01:45.940 --> 01:46.780
Chunhua!

01:47.740 --> 01:48.380
Chunhua!

01:50.300 --> 01:50.900
Chunhua!

01:50.900 --> 01:51.260
Stop right there!

01:51.460 --> 01:51.940
(Wenmo Pavilion)
Who are you?

01:52.700 --> 01:53.620
Where did this lunatic come from?

01:53.740 --> 01:54.220
Let me go!

01:54.220 --> 01:54.580
Get lost!

01:54.980 --> 01:55.500
Let me through!

01:55.500 --> 01:56.460
How dare you
disrupt Prince of Jin's wedding!

01:57.060 --> 01:57.660
Do you have a death wish?

01:57.660 --> 01:58.220
Chunhua!

02:00.300 --> 02:02.340
Please, just let me talk to you
one more time!

02:02.340 --> 02:03.100
Chunhua!

02:03.860 --> 02:05.580
Please, let me see you one last time!

02:07.300 --> 02:08.180
Chunhua!

02:08.620 --> 02:09.740
(Wenmo Pavilion)

02:16.860 --> 02:17.860
Liu Wenji...

02:21.140 --> 02:22.420
Goodbye.

02:24.940 --> 02:25.780
Chunhua!

02:27.860 --> 02:28.900
Chunhua!

02:30.980 --> 02:34.660
♪To forge a blade within the heart,
one must temper it with hate♪

02:34.660 --> 02:35.180
Chunhua!

02:35.940 --> 02:36.420
Chunhua!

02:37.340 --> 02:37.780
Chunhua!

02:39.900 --> 02:40.420
Chunhua!

02:42.700 --> 02:46.460
♪Ask not why spring is so hard to leave;
One fleeting moment, forever captive♪

02:46.460 --> 02:50.100
♪Ask not why spring is so hard to leave;
One fleeting moment, forever captive♪

02:50.180 --> 02:50.940
That's what you get for barging in!

02:51.340 --> 02:51.860
Go die!

02:51.860 --> 02:52.860
♪Fate falls just short
of granting our plea♪

02:52.980 --> 02:54.980
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

02:54.980 --> 02:55.500
Die, you prick!

02:55.660 --> 02:59.140
♪The past dissolves like smoke♪

02:59.260 --> 03:03.240
♪Ask not why longing has no end,
I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

03:03.240 --> 03:06.900
♪Ask not why longing has no end,
I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

03:07.220 --> 03:09.300
♪May sorrow end, though sleepless
we lie apart♪

03:09.420 --> 03:11.420
♪Each quietly endures the passing years♪

03:11.820 --> 03:15.900
♪Though close at hand,
we're worlds apart♪

03:16.180 --> 03:20.140
♪Ask not how we've braved power's tides,
through fading grass and setting suns♪

03:20.140 --> 03:23.860
♪Ask not how we've braved power's tides,
through fading grass and setting suns♪

03:24.420 --> 03:27.940
♪Distant memories rise once more♪

03:28.460 --> 03:33.500
♪Could we meet anew in another life?♪

03:36.420 --> 03:37.940
It's all your own fault.

03:39.980 --> 03:41.740
She was so good to you.

03:43.260 --> 03:45.540
You had so many chances.

03:47.940 --> 03:48.660
Why?

03:51.460 --> 03:52.620
Why put himself through this?

03:52.620 --> 03:53.020
Just look at him.

03:53.660 --> 03:55.540
(Wenmo Pavilion)

03:55.540 --> 03:56.500
- Who is that?
- What's he doing?

03:56.500 --> 03:57.060
Wenji.

04:01.860 --> 04:02.380
Wenji.

04:04.700 --> 04:05.060
Get up.

04:17.180 --> 04:18.420
It's all shattered.

04:27.580 --> 04:27.900
Come on.

04:29.340 --> 04:29.940
Let's go home.

04:37.580 --> 04:38.020
Go home.

04:47.180 --> 04:47.660
Let's go home.

04:51.980 --> 04:53.300
Don't stay here. Go home.

04:53.300 --> 04:54.420
You're ruining their wedding day!

04:56.060 --> 04:57.340
Look at that magnificent bridal sedan.

04:57.340 --> 04:58.020
Exactly!

05:16.300 --> 05:22.380
♪A daughter ventures forth,
in the name her father gave♪

05:22.820 --> 05:28.900
♪Into savage lands, to tame tigers
and slay wolves♪

05:30.420 --> 05:36.380
♪The fate is sealed,
a destiny bestowed by Heaven♪

05:36.380 --> 05:37.020
(Chunhua,)

05:38.620 --> 05:39.500
(I once promised)

05:40.100 --> 05:41.980
(that you'd marry a man
of your own choosing)

05:42.940 --> 05:43.940
(and have a magnificent wedding.)

05:45.420 --> 05:46.300
(What I could never have,)

05:47.260 --> 05:48.460
(I wanted you to have.)

05:50.940 --> 05:51.540
(But)

05:52.420 --> 05:53.340
(I failed you.)

05:53.340 --> 05:59.300
♪Defy its scorn,
stain the sky with blood♪

05:59.740 --> 06:03.700
♪We weren't born for sacrifice.
Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

06:03.900 --> 06:06.340
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪

06:06.500 --> 06:10.020
♪Cold as a blade,
yet peerless as a bloom♪

06:10.340 --> 06:13.860
♪Who dares make me bow
down in the dust?♪

06:13.900 --> 06:18.140
♪With sacrificed innocence
and a soul snowbound♪

06:18.260 --> 06:20.780
♪If the road is blocked,
I'll fight my way through♪

06:20.860 --> 06:23.980
♪Cut down the crowd,
strike down the proud gods♪

06:24.100 --> 06:27.220
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

06:27.900 --> 06:31.940
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

06:32.460 --> 06:35.260
♪Don't be afraid,
I'll become a demon for you♪

06:35.300 --> 06:39.300
♪Through fire, I'll turn the
dark towers bright as day for you♪

06:39.300 --> 06:39.940
(Chunhua,)

06:40.900 --> 06:41.940
(one day,)

06:43.180 --> 06:44.900
(I'll bring those people to their knees)

06:46.020 --> 06:49.260
(so they can never hurt us again.)

06:49.420 --> 06:54.180
♪I'll guard my princess,
and keep her tears at bay♪

07:00.220 --> 07:04.320
♪Mourn the blooms of youth,
mourn my bridal hair♪

07:04.320 --> 07:08.700
♪Mourn the blooms of youth,
mourn my bridal hair♪

07:09.340 --> 07:14.540
♪Not another tear shall fall♪

07:26.140 --> 07:27.340
What does the Yellow Emperor's
Inner Canon say?

07:27.900 --> 07:30.100
"Eat to excess, and you harm
your stomach and intestines."

07:30.500 --> 07:31.300
Eat slowly.

07:31.500 --> 07:32.340
Don't overeat.

07:32.900 --> 07:34.660
Father, I've barely taken my first bite.

07:35.020 --> 07:35.580
Enough.

07:36.100 --> 07:36.820
Don't be cheeky.

07:37.580 --> 07:39.900
I told you to visit Chancellor Liu
whenever you can.

07:39.900 --> 07:40.900
Have you been doing that?

07:41.260 --> 07:41.940
Of course.

07:42.900 --> 07:44.500
I'd love to visit him even more often.

07:45.380 --> 07:45.780
That's my boy.

07:48.180 --> 07:48.660
Zidu,

07:50.580 --> 07:51.500
speaking of which,

07:52.940 --> 07:54.060
the Crown Prince

07:54.580 --> 07:55.860
has been unusually quiet lately.

08:08.420 --> 08:10.540
The Crown Prince hasn't left
his residence in months.

08:11.140 --> 08:13.620
Only his study companion, Yang Si,
comes and goes every day.

08:14.340 --> 08:16.940
Ever since joining the Court of Judicial
Review, he's never missed a day,

08:17.340 --> 08:18.060
rain or shine. Very diligent indeed.

08:18.860 --> 08:19.620
Yang Si...

08:21.060 --> 08:23.220
Wanyao seems rather close to him.

08:25.620 --> 08:28.900
I hear Princess Danyang and he
are childhood friends.

08:29.900 --> 08:31.540
Since he arrived in the capital,

08:31.740 --> 08:34.740
Princess Danyang has visited
the Eastern Palace several times.

08:35.940 --> 08:37.500
Since the Crown Prince

08:38.820 --> 08:41.900
allows Wanyao to visit so freely,

08:41.980 --> 08:45.500
he must want to arrange a match
between them.

08:45.940 --> 08:48.660
Young people can never hide
their intentions.

08:53.740 --> 08:54.100
Father,

08:55.900 --> 08:57.100
speaking of Princess Danyang,

08:57.620 --> 08:58.500
I happened to see

08:58.500 --> 08:59.860
Prince of Jin's wedding procession
today!

09:00.660 --> 09:02.020
I didn't see the bride, though.

09:02.620 --> 09:03.860
I hear she's a stunning beauty.

09:04.300 --> 09:06.380
Prince of Jin was smitten
the moment he saw her.

09:07.420 --> 09:08.740
Father, you should've seen it.

09:08.980 --> 09:10.500
The streets were packed with spectators.

09:11.500 --> 09:11.860
Wait.

09:13.780 --> 09:14.980
Prince of Jin's wedding?

09:15.740 --> 09:17.100
What does that have to do with Wanyao?

09:18.460 --> 09:20.340
He married
one of Princess Danyang's maids.

09:22.500 --> 09:23.140
Which maid?

09:24.380 --> 09:25.580
The one who went to North Jing with her.

09:28.100 --> 09:29.420
That maid is still alive?

09:31.820 --> 09:32.420
Oh, Father,

09:33.380 --> 09:34.500
I found out something else.

09:35.540 --> 09:35.980
Guess what?

09:37.020 --> 09:39.500
No matter how beautiful a maid is,

09:39.740 --> 09:41.140
how could she rise so high overnight?

09:42.140 --> 09:43.580
According to someone at the Imperial
Medical Office,

09:44.260 --> 09:45.900
it's because she's pregnant!

09:47.260 --> 09:48.020
Is that true?

09:49.460 --> 09:50.940
That's what the people
at the Imperial Medical Office said.

09:51.380 --> 09:52.260
Which physician said that?

09:52.980 --> 09:53.660
Imperial Physician Huang.

09:54.580 --> 09:54.980
Sir,

09:56.060 --> 09:57.460
something doesn't quite add up.

09:58.340 --> 09:58.940
But...

09:59.380 --> 10:02.140
Whether by chance or design,
I cannot say.

10:05.660 --> 10:06.940
A marriage can be arranged.

10:10.580 --> 10:12.260
But if she's truly with child,

10:12.540 --> 10:13.940
that's heaven's will.

10:14.620 --> 10:16.180
Heaven itself is on my side.

10:18.140 --> 10:18.580
Then...

10:19.460 --> 10:20.220
Congratulations, sir.

10:22.820 --> 10:23.180
Mr. Wei,

10:23.740 --> 10:24.420
what are you congratulating him for?

10:26.540 --> 10:27.340
You're a grown man.

10:27.620 --> 10:30.180
Stop wasting your days chasing gossip.

10:30.780 --> 10:33.460
Tomorrow, pay a visit
to the Prince of Jin's residence for me.

10:34.020 --> 10:34.420
Sure!

10:35.100 --> 10:35.580
What for?

10:36.740 --> 10:37.100
Zidu,

10:38.140 --> 10:40.060
prepare a generous gift.

10:40.380 --> 10:42.020
Have Xianyao deliver it
to the Prince of Jin's residence.

10:42.420 --> 10:42.740
Certainly.

10:44.580 --> 10:46.580
But what does any of this
have to do with us?

10:47.500 --> 10:50.860
It's been years since the Mu imperial
family had a new baby.

10:51.420 --> 10:52.300
That's worth celebrating.

10:52.860 --> 10:53.540
Indeed.

10:55.060 --> 10:57.460
If that maid

10:58.180 --> 11:01.540
really gives Prince of Jin a son
and heir,

11:02.260 --> 11:04.460
that would be cause
for a grand celebration.

11:23.500 --> 11:23.940
Shang.

11:28.020 --> 11:29.500
Why has everything

11:31.740 --> 11:32.820
suddenly changed?

11:39.260 --> 11:40.380
I come from a respectable family.

11:42.940 --> 11:44.380
I'm a good scholar.

11:45.380 --> 11:46.660
I'm not bad-looking.

11:50.140 --> 11:51.660
I'm a decent person too, aren't I?

11:54.740 --> 11:57.380
I came to Sheng'an full of ambition,

11:59.420 --> 12:01.580
dreaming of becoming a noble
or chancellor.

12:05.020 --> 12:07.740
Chunhua and I were in love.

12:10.540 --> 12:12.460
All we lacked was a marriage deed.

12:14.260 --> 12:15.780
Everything was going so well.

12:17.180 --> 12:19.340
How did it all come to this?

12:26.580 --> 12:27.060
Wenji,

12:29.060 --> 12:29.860
get some sleep first,

12:30.980 --> 12:31.380
all right?

12:32.620 --> 12:33.300
For the next few days,

12:34.060 --> 12:35.140
you can stay here with me.

12:43.020 --> 12:43.380
Shang,

12:44.660 --> 12:45.100
tell me...

12:47.300 --> 12:48.900
Am I really that worthless?

12:50.660 --> 12:51.100
Otherwise,

12:52.220 --> 12:53.540
why would she marry the Prince of Jin?

12:56.220 --> 12:57.580
She's not someone who chases
wealth and status.

13:01.180 --> 13:02.500
Chunhua is a good person.

13:03.980 --> 13:04.460
Wenji,

13:05.380 --> 13:06.020
so are you.

13:07.260 --> 13:08.220
The fault lies with the Prince of Jin.

13:09.300 --> 13:10.180
And with Yu Cheng'an.

13:10.940 --> 13:11.460
Not with you.

13:12.380 --> 13:13.380
And certainly not with Chunhua.

13:16.340 --> 13:18.700
Then why did things turn out this way?

13:22.580 --> 13:23.340
Why?

13:26.740 --> 13:29.060
How did everything come to this?

13:33.260 --> 13:34.140
Why?

13:41.260 --> 13:42.260
Why did this happen?

14:20.380 --> 14:21.220
Greetings, Your Highness.

14:26.540 --> 14:27.900
Your name is Chunhua?

14:29.500 --> 14:29.980
Yes.

14:34.500 --> 14:36.460
Why do you look so familiar?

14:38.140 --> 14:41.220
When I served Princess Danyang,

14:42.060 --> 14:43.420
I had the honor of meeting you
a few times.

14:49.900 --> 14:50.780
I hear

14:52.540 --> 14:53.740
you're expecting a child.

15:01.140 --> 15:01.660
Yes.

15:11.860 --> 15:12.260
Move aside.

15:17.340 --> 15:19.420
I thought the servants were just
spreading rumors.

15:20.460 --> 15:21.860
I can't believe it's actually true.

15:22.780 --> 15:23.580
Wonderful! Just wonderful!

15:25.220 --> 15:25.780
Wonderful!

15:28.380 --> 15:29.300
You've only just arrived.

15:29.780 --> 15:31.060
You must not be used to the food
and accommodations.

15:33.380 --> 15:34.700
I'll visit Princess Danyang today

15:35.020 --> 15:36.580
and have your usual food and belongings

15:37.540 --> 15:39.580
brought here, along with a cook for you.

15:41.220 --> 15:41.540
Oh, right!

15:41.900 --> 15:43.980
As for your furnishings and bedding,

15:44.540 --> 15:46.300
I'll personally select the finest
from the storeroom.

15:47.100 --> 15:47.860
After all,

15:48.300 --> 15:49.580
your comfort matters most.

15:51.740 --> 15:53.060
Oh, and give the order.

15:53.500 --> 15:55.420
Have several new dresses made
for my dear Chunhua,

15:55.900 --> 15:56.900
along with some fine jewelry.

15:57.940 --> 15:58.620
- Yes.
- Yes.

16:00.420 --> 16:00.700
Come on.

16:02.340 --> 16:03.500
If you need anything from now on,

16:03.740 --> 16:04.580
just let me know.

16:05.420 --> 16:06.620
From this day forward,

16:07.100 --> 16:09.380
you're the most precious person
in this household.

16:10.780 --> 16:11.140
Sit down.

16:15.220 --> 16:15.900
How wonderful.

16:17.580 --> 16:19.100
What are you standing around for?
Go pour some water!

16:20.260 --> 16:20.780
- Yes.
- Yes.

16:25.140 --> 16:25.900
Thank you, Your Highness.

16:26.540 --> 16:27.660
Don't call me "Your Highness".

16:28.140 --> 16:29.300
Call me Lingyi!

16:36.020 --> 16:36.580
Are you tired?

16:38.860 --> 16:40.180
Look how thin you are.

16:47.860 --> 16:48.380
Thank you for your trouble.

16:49.020 --> 16:49.500
Not at all.

16:49.980 --> 16:50.980
The Chancellor has instructed us

16:51.180 --> 16:52.140
that whether he's home or not,

16:52.220 --> 16:53.940
you're always welcome
to enter his study.

16:54.540 --> 16:55.220
This way, please.

16:55.660 --> 16:56.020
Thank you.

17:18.380 --> 17:23.100
(Liu Ruozhu, Chancellor Liu's Daughter)

17:23.220 --> 17:24.700
Like sounds resonate,

17:25.220 --> 17:26.700
and like energies attract.

17:29.100 --> 17:30.580
Like sounds resonate,

17:31.540 --> 17:33.020
and like energies attract.

17:36.620 --> 17:37.060
Who?

17:37.780 --> 17:38.460
Who's there?

17:41.940 --> 17:42.420
My apologies.

17:43.300 --> 17:44.780
Miss, I didn't mean to disturb you.

17:45.340 --> 17:46.460
I didn't want to startle you,

17:47.020 --> 17:48.180
so I announced my presence.

17:49.700 --> 17:50.580
May I have your name, sir?

17:51.100 --> 17:52.660
What brings you here?

17:54.340 --> 17:55.220
I'm Yan Shang.

17:55.660 --> 17:57.580
Chancellor Liu invited me here to read.

17:59.300 --> 18:00.740
So you're Yan Shang.

18:02.780 --> 18:03.940
My father has mentioned you.

18:08.940 --> 18:09.620
Just now,

18:10.380 --> 18:12.180
I heard you reciting
the Book of Changes?

18:13.380 --> 18:13.860
Yes.

18:14.420 --> 18:15.900
Those two lines suggest

18:16.300 --> 18:18.260
that things of a kind respond
to one another.

18:18.940 --> 18:20.300
It sounds strangely familiar.

18:20.900 --> 18:21.700
I feel as though

18:22.220 --> 18:23.500
I've come across the same idea

18:23.820 --> 18:25.140
in another ancient text.

18:25.980 --> 18:26.740
I know the feeling.

18:27.460 --> 18:29.380
When you can't remember
where you read something,

18:29.700 --> 18:30.860
the question keeps nagging at you.

18:31.580 --> 18:32.580
You just can't let it go

18:32.980 --> 18:34.100
until you find the answer.

18:35.420 --> 18:36.980
Does that happen to you too?

18:37.340 --> 18:37.740
Yes.

18:40.780 --> 18:41.380
Miss,

18:42.220 --> 18:43.740
can you remember any other clues?

18:48.260 --> 18:51.060
I recall it had a similar rhythm
and structure.

18:52.100 --> 18:54.100
Perhaps from a text of the Qin
or Han dynasty.

18:54.860 --> 18:57.620
Amber attracts straw,
and magnets draw needles.

18:59.740 --> 19:00.980
Is it from Wang Chong's Lunheng?

19:02.620 --> 19:03.100
Yes!

19:03.460 --> 19:04.260
That's exactly it!

19:05.620 --> 19:06.580
How did you know?

19:07.100 --> 19:08.820
I happened to read it a few years ago.

19:09.820 --> 19:10.260
Lv'e,

19:10.580 --> 19:12.020
go to the second shelf
of the Xuan bookcase

19:12.340 --> 19:13.580
and fetch me the Lunheng.

19:14.340 --> 19:14.700
Yes.

19:15.900 --> 19:16.500
That's the one.

19:33.020 --> 19:33.540
Thank you.

19:36.260 --> 19:36.860
You're welcome.

19:37.620 --> 19:39.180
I need someone to read aloud to me.

19:39.740 --> 19:41.140
I'm afraid that might disturb
your reading.

19:41.820 --> 19:42.180
Lv'e,

19:42.700 --> 19:43.260
let's go.

19:59.180 --> 20:00.860
I've been here three times
and still haven't seen her.

20:01.420 --> 20:02.620
I wonder what she looks like.

20:02.980 --> 20:04.660
The suspense is killing me!

20:06.660 --> 20:07.900
I heard a magpie chirping this morning.

20:08.220 --> 20:08.500
Sir.

20:08.820 --> 20:10.100
Perhaps you'll meet her today.

20:10.460 --> 20:11.620
You always know what to say!

20:17.780 --> 20:18.820
Sir, look over there!

20:47.180 --> 20:47.620
Lv'e.

20:49.900 --> 20:50.340
Lv'e.

20:52.820 --> 20:53.300
Lv'e.

21:04.940 --> 21:05.420
Lv'e.

21:06.620 --> 21:07.420
Stop playing tricks on me.

21:23.660 --> 21:25.340
Why so careless, Miss?

21:25.460 --> 21:26.340
- Who's there?
- Miss.

21:27.380 --> 21:28.620
How did you end up on the ground?

21:28.820 --> 21:29.860
Why don't you beg me?

21:29.980 --> 21:30.700
Let me help you up.

21:34.220 --> 21:34.860
Who's there?

21:35.900 --> 21:36.620
Forgive me, sir.

21:39.660 --> 21:40.140
My savior?

21:41.540 --> 21:42.380
It really is you!

21:43.060 --> 21:43.900
I'm Yan Shang.

21:44.540 --> 21:46.220
Thanks to you and your father's
wise judgment,

21:46.500 --> 21:47.620
I was saved from certain death.

21:48.180 --> 21:50.260
I never expected to run into you here.

21:51.180 --> 21:52.260
So you're Yan Shang?

21:52.620 --> 21:53.020
Yes.

21:54.620 --> 21:56.060
You're the one who ordered

21:56.380 --> 21:57.300
my release from the Investigation
Office, right?

21:57.860 --> 21:59.740
I've never forgotten your kindness!

22:01.940 --> 22:02.180
Right.

22:02.580 --> 22:03.380
- Yes, exactly.
- Lv'e.

22:04.500 --> 22:04.980
Please,

22:06.060 --> 22:07.220
do me the honor

22:07.740 --> 22:08.660
of letting me repay your kindness.

22:09.700 --> 22:10.500
How about Cuiyun Tower?

22:10.740 --> 22:10.980
Let's go!

22:11.340 --> 22:11.780
Cuiyun Tower!

22:12.060 --> 22:12.300
Let's go!

22:12.860 --> 22:14.140
- I'm busy today.
- Come on!

22:14.940 --> 22:15.700
What a fortunate coincidence!

22:15.700 --> 22:16.380
How about another day?

22:16.380 --> 22:17.020
Let's drink to our hearts' content!

22:17.220 --> 22:18.060
- Does it have to be today?
- After you!

22:18.060 --> 22:18.660
Come on, let's go!

22:18.700 --> 22:19.460
All right, all right.

22:27.380 --> 22:28.100
Ruozhu.

22:29.540 --> 22:31.980
Yu Xianyao came by today.

22:32.740 --> 22:34.340
Did he run into you?

22:35.540 --> 22:36.180
Yes, he did.

22:37.260 --> 22:38.900
Fortunately, Yan Shang arrived
just in time

22:39.340 --> 22:40.380
and took him away.

22:41.620 --> 22:42.140
Father,

22:42.900 --> 22:44.380
that man is truly vile and repulsive.

22:44.860 --> 22:46.260
He hardly seems educated.

22:46.820 --> 22:48.220
I really don't understand

22:48.620 --> 22:50.180
what the Yu family is doing here.

22:50.860 --> 22:52.260
They only defile my garden.

22:53.020 --> 22:55.220
He's certainly no scholar.

22:55.820 --> 22:56.500
It's merely that

22:56.780 --> 22:58.580
his father, Yu Cheng'an,

22:58.900 --> 23:00.020
sends him here frequently

23:00.340 --> 23:01.540
to polish his reputation

23:01.620 --> 23:03.660
and show how broad-minded he is.

23:05.020 --> 23:05.420
Ruozhu,

23:05.940 --> 23:06.660
don't worry.

23:07.580 --> 23:08.620
First thing tomorrow,

23:08.980 --> 23:10.300
I'll tell the gatekeeper

23:10.980 --> 23:12.100
that when I'm away,

23:12.660 --> 23:14.780
no one may enter,

23:15.580 --> 23:17.300
regardless of their status.

23:17.580 --> 23:18.180
Father,

23:19.020 --> 23:20.740
Yan Shang is a true lover of books.

23:21.460 --> 23:22.780
He's also brave and chivalrous.

23:23.660 --> 23:24.980
Surely he can still come in?

23:27.700 --> 23:28.300
Ruozhu,

23:29.620 --> 23:30.380
what do you think

23:30.740 --> 23:32.780
of this student I've taken
under my wing?

23:32.900 --> 23:33.860
Father,

23:34.220 --> 23:35.220
answer my question first.

23:36.020 --> 23:36.700
Just now,

23:37.180 --> 23:38.380
how was my zither playing?

23:43.340 --> 23:44.660
The Crane's Cry.

23:44.820 --> 23:46.260
Its cry reaches the heavens.

23:47.020 --> 23:47.620
Indeed,

23:48.340 --> 23:49.580
your music was clear and serene.

23:51.740 --> 23:52.820
I believe

23:53.700 --> 23:55.380
Yan Shang is no ordinary man.

23:55.980 --> 23:57.900
He's like a white crane
with snowy feathers and a clear cry.

23:58.740 --> 23:59.580
One day,

24:00.260 --> 24:01.460
his name will be known
throughout the realm.

24:21.940 --> 24:23.300
You've borrowed so many books.

24:23.900 --> 24:24.860
Do you have that much free time?

24:26.220 --> 24:27.380
Wenji hasn't recovered
from his injuries.

24:27.980 --> 24:29.700
I'll spend the next few days
reading at home,

24:30.420 --> 24:31.340
so I can keep him company.

24:44.500 --> 24:45.380
You're a third-ranked scholar,

24:46.340 --> 24:47.540
yet you still haven't been appointed
to office.

24:49.940 --> 24:51.660
Has Wei Shu received his appointment?

24:53.100 --> 24:54.580
For someone so hopeless with words,

24:55.260 --> 24:56.620
he somehow got assigned
to the Censorate.

24:57.860 --> 25:00.020
Perhaps it suits his temperament
after all.

25:05.500 --> 25:06.140
No matter.

25:07.100 --> 25:08.260
I may not be as accomplished as Wei Shu,

25:09.020 --> 25:09.980
but I have someone powerful
looking after me.

25:10.580 --> 25:12.380
Even if I never draw a salary
from the court,

25:13.140 --> 25:14.380
I'll always have Your Highness
to support me.

25:17.460 --> 25:18.500
You placed among the top three

25:18.860 --> 25:20.060
and you're my favored companion.

25:20.820 --> 25:22.340
If you don't get a respectable position,

25:22.700 --> 25:23.740
won't that reflect badly on me?

25:27.540 --> 25:29.020
I'll go myself

25:29.340 --> 25:29.860
and inquire on your behalf.

25:30.900 --> 25:31.300
Your Highness.

25:33.420 --> 25:35.420
It would be easy to seek
the Crown Prince's help,

25:35.980 --> 25:36.900
but the path would be fraught
with difficulties.

25:38.140 --> 25:38.620
What a coincidence!

25:39.100 --> 25:40.620
We're thinking alike again.

25:41.780 --> 25:43.020
I'm going to see Yu Cheng'an.

25:54.060 --> 25:54.740
Thank you, Lord Yu.

25:55.980 --> 25:57.860
For Yan Shang again?

26:00.660 --> 26:02.940
Previously, to save him,

26:03.220 --> 26:04.700
you personally visited
the Investigation Office.

26:05.140 --> 26:07.860
Now you've come to see me in person

26:08.340 --> 26:09.340
to secure

26:09.980 --> 26:10.980
an official post for him.

26:11.460 --> 26:11.860
Your Highness,

26:12.380 --> 26:13.460
he's merely a male favorite.

26:13.940 --> 26:15.820
You're giving him
far too much attention.

26:16.860 --> 26:17.820
Well, he did earn

26:18.460 --> 26:19.940
his third-place ranking on his own.

26:21.420 --> 26:22.220
Besides,

26:22.820 --> 26:24.580
he knows just how to please me,

26:25.260 --> 26:27.420
and he's exactly my type.

26:28.580 --> 26:30.820
Surely he's worth a little extra effort.

26:32.100 --> 26:33.260
If you truly care about me, Lord Yu,

26:33.740 --> 26:34.900
please do me this one favor.

26:36.900 --> 26:37.380
Your Highness,

26:38.740 --> 26:39.260
that man

26:40.100 --> 26:42.060
managed to land himself in prison.

26:42.060 --> 26:43.740
He's clearly a troublemaker.

26:44.140 --> 26:44.820
Your Highness,

26:45.580 --> 26:47.340
no matter how fond you are of him,

26:47.540 --> 26:48.700
you must know your limits,

26:49.220 --> 26:50.580
lest you invite more gossip.

26:51.380 --> 26:52.540
I've already been the subject

26:52.940 --> 26:54.140
of more gossip than I can count.

26:55.020 --> 26:56.180
What's a little more?

26:57.260 --> 26:58.860
Thank you for your concern, Lord Yu.

26:59.420 --> 27:00.260
Of course. Of course.

27:01.060 --> 27:01.380
Have some tea.

27:09.620 --> 27:11.060
I hear you've visited

27:11.580 --> 27:12.860
the Eastern Palace several times lately.

27:13.220 --> 27:14.260
Is that true?

27:18.460 --> 27:19.900
Nothing gets past you, does it?

27:21.380 --> 27:22.500
Yang Si was away from the capital
for so long.

27:23.020 --> 27:24.980
Now he's back, he spends all day
at the Eastern Palace.

27:26.140 --> 27:27.100
Although

27:27.420 --> 27:29.060
my feelings for Yan Shang are genuine,

27:29.980 --> 27:31.220
Yang Si and I

27:31.740 --> 27:33.260
have been close since childhood.

27:34.980 --> 27:35.380
I see.

27:37.260 --> 27:39.220
Then between Yang Si

27:40.220 --> 27:41.380
and Yan Shang,

27:41.860 --> 27:42.500
which one

27:43.180 --> 27:43.860
holds your heart?

27:49.380 --> 27:50.380
I'm a lady.

27:51.220 --> 27:53.100
That's such an embarrassing question.

27:53.660 --> 27:55.980
Lord Yu, please don't put me
on the spot.

27:57.020 --> 27:57.780
All right, all right.

27:58.180 --> 27:58.700
Very well.

27:59.060 --> 27:59.460
Yes,

28:00.020 --> 28:00.980
I shouldn't have asked.

28:02.380 --> 28:04.180
Since you've come here personally,

28:04.260 --> 28:06.900
you must already have a position in mind

28:06.900 --> 28:08.860
for the third-place scholar.

28:09.180 --> 28:10.140
Let's hear it.

28:11.380 --> 28:12.220
How about a Secretary
at the Ministry of Personnel?

28:14.340 --> 28:15.260
Or, the Ministry of Revenue
would do too.

28:16.540 --> 28:18.340
Your Highness, do you know

28:18.780 --> 28:20.300
what these positions actually entail?

28:21.180 --> 28:22.580
I've already looked into them.

28:23.580 --> 28:26.020
They oversee important
administrative affairs

28:26.540 --> 28:28.500
and come with plenty of perks.

28:29.260 --> 28:30.660
So many people are vying for them.

28:31.100 --> 28:32.540
Without your approval,

28:33.140 --> 28:34.860
how could my male favorite ever get one?

28:36.060 --> 28:36.900
Even with my approval,

28:38.140 --> 28:38.980
they wouldn't suit him.

28:39.900 --> 28:40.780
Lord Yu!

28:43.020 --> 28:44.100
These positions

28:44.540 --> 28:45.820
are mired in corruption.

28:46.420 --> 28:48.180
He's a young man from out of town,

28:48.460 --> 28:49.620
and rather impulsive.

28:49.900 --> 28:51.300
They really wouldn't suit him.

28:57.940 --> 28:59.180
Then, in your opinion,

28:59.740 --> 29:00.860
what position would suit him?

29:02.300 --> 29:02.940
Why not make him

29:03.820 --> 29:06.260
a Collator at Hongwen Hall?

29:06.980 --> 29:08.020
It's a respectable scholarly post,

29:08.380 --> 29:10.660
worthy of his third-place ranking.

29:17.060 --> 29:18.020
I'll leave it in your hands, Lord Yu.

29:29.740 --> 29:30.100
Good morning!

29:30.100 --> 29:32.220
(Hongwen Hall;
Pursuit of Wisdom; Quiet Contemplation)

29:40.860 --> 29:42.900
I think yesterday's annotation
was incorrect.

29:44.140 --> 29:45.580
Then I'll revise it now.

29:47.620 --> 29:49.340
Who's collecting today's
proofreading work?

29:56.540 --> 29:56.940
I'm Yan Shang.

30:00.820 --> 30:01.260
Thank you.

30:21.580 --> 30:22.100
Cui Ren,

30:22.580 --> 30:24.540
your insight is truly remarkable.

30:24.620 --> 30:27.860
(Cui Ren, Collator at Hongwen Hall;
Wang She, Collator at Hongwen Hall)

30:44.900 --> 30:45.660
Excuse me, sir,

30:47.540 --> 30:48.260
may I use

30:49.020 --> 30:49.780
this desk?

30:49.780 --> 30:51.660
(Xu Jiangping, Collator at Hongwen Hall)

31:00.180 --> 31:01.380
How far standards have fallen!

31:02.460 --> 31:03.900
Someone who trades on his looks

31:04.140 --> 31:05.900
can now hold the same rank as us!

31:07.700 --> 31:08.540
Xu Jiangping.

31:09.940 --> 31:10.300
What?

31:10.860 --> 31:12.620
Are you afraid of his powerful backer?

31:13.220 --> 31:13.980
Well, I'm not.

31:14.580 --> 31:15.060
She's nothing

31:15.540 --> 31:16.620
but a widow.

31:17.540 --> 31:18.260
A widow?

31:19.580 --> 31:20.340
Do you mean

31:20.780 --> 31:21.780
Princess Danyang?

31:32.660 --> 31:33.900
Princess Danyang is a widow

31:34.340 --> 31:36.260
because the military governor
of the Central Circuit died young.

31:37.140 --> 31:38.340
She married him

31:38.660 --> 31:40.460
to secure peace for part of Huai.

31:41.140 --> 31:43.660
She sacrificed her own happiness
for the realm.

31:44.460 --> 31:45.380
Shouldn't we men

31:45.820 --> 31:46.620
feel ashamed

31:47.700 --> 31:49.140
rather than spread malicious rumors
about her?

31:49.940 --> 31:50.900
Your words were inappropriate,
weren't they?

31:57.060 --> 31:58.300
You've got quite a sharp tongue.

31:59.100 --> 32:00.060
So that's what

32:01.420 --> 32:02.060
the Princess likes.

32:04.980 --> 32:06.100
There's something you don't know.

32:06.980 --> 32:08.020
What the Princess admires

32:08.540 --> 32:09.740
is my skill with a bow.

32:10.300 --> 32:10.900
That much is true.

32:12.260 --> 32:13.780
When Yan Shang shot Zheng Xing

32:14.100 --> 32:15.020
and was imprisoned
at the Investigation Office,

32:15.780 --> 32:16.900
it was a courageous act.

32:23.260 --> 32:23.700
Of course,

32:24.380 --> 32:26.540
the Princess also appreciates
my good looks.

32:28.020 --> 32:28.620
But

32:29.540 --> 32:31.260
you're quite handsome yourself.

32:31.780 --> 32:33.420
Perhaps she'd find you
even more attractive.

32:33.940 --> 32:34.380
Why don't

32:34.860 --> 32:36.420
I introduce you to her?

32:40.300 --> 32:40.980
No, no need!

32:54.220 --> 32:55.700
Annotating the History
of the Northern Dynasties?

32:58.980 --> 33:01.580
I hear its editions vary widely
and contain many errors.

33:01.860 --> 33:02.780
Tracing them back to their sources

33:03.380 --> 33:04.940
gives me a headache
just thinking about it.

33:05.740 --> 33:06.540
Tell me about it.

33:07.020 --> 33:08.340
It's given me a few gray hairs.

33:11.060 --> 33:12.100
I'm new here

33:12.260 --> 33:12.980
and still learning the ropes.

33:13.460 --> 33:14.460
I'm especially inexperienced
at proofreading.

33:15.140 --> 33:15.620
I hope

33:16.220 --> 33:16.940
you'll offer me some guidance.

33:18.140 --> 33:18.700
You're too modest.

33:19.780 --> 33:20.340
We can learn from each other.

33:27.980 --> 33:29.760
(Wei's ancestors descended from Emperor
Xuanyuan. His son was named Changyi.)

33:29.760 --> 33:31.620
(Changyi's youngest son ruled
the north. Named after Mount Xianbei.)

33:34.380 --> 33:35.660
In the Princess's library,

33:36.300 --> 33:37.940
I believe there are several
older editions.

33:40.140 --> 33:40.820
Please tell me more.

33:43.140 --> 33:45.780
I've long heard that Princess Danyang
is an avid book collector.

33:47.340 --> 33:48.460
I wonder if you could

33:49.060 --> 33:50.420
borrow those editions for us to examine?

33:51.100 --> 33:51.420
Yes.

33:51.700 --> 33:52.780
Could you bring them here?

34:35.300 --> 34:36.020
Try this!

34:37.460 --> 34:39.060
Come, let me drink to you!

34:40.820 --> 34:41.180
Try some.

34:41.180 --> 34:41.740
Let me fill your cup.

34:41.820 --> 34:42.900
How interesting.

34:46.620 --> 34:46.980
Delicious.

34:47.460 --> 34:48.500
All right, all right.

34:50.620 --> 34:51.460
Fill it up! Fill it up!

34:52.860 --> 34:53.340
Cheers!

34:53.340 --> 34:54.020
I'll drink first.

35:11.500 --> 35:12.020
Wenji!

35:12.820 --> 35:13.620
I finished work early today.

35:13.780 --> 35:14.900
I picked up three days' worth
of medicine for you.

35:15.340 --> 35:16.460
I also bought some mutton pastries.

35:16.780 --> 35:17.540
Try them while they're hot!

35:34.700 --> 35:36.140
Your archery skills really
are incredible, sir.

35:36.300 --> 35:37.820
You even shot a wild roe deer.

35:37.820 --> 35:39.660
Of course! Who do you think I am?

35:40.260 --> 35:41.820
Waiter! Bring me your finest food
and wine!

35:42.180 --> 35:42.500
Coming right up!

35:46.580 --> 35:46.940
Good, isn't it?

35:47.380 --> 35:48.380
How dare you get in my way?

35:48.820 --> 35:49.260
I'll show you...

35:49.260 --> 35:50.500
(Zhang Jun,
Son of the Minister of Revenue)

35:50.500 --> 35:51.260
Don't be afraid, dear.

35:51.900 --> 35:52.860
(Chunniang)
Well, hello, pretty lady!

35:53.100 --> 35:54.180
Aren't you a beauty!

35:54.260 --> 35:55.300
Come have a drink with me!

35:55.300 --> 35:55.660
Go away!

35:55.660 --> 35:56.780
I'll pay you handsomely.

35:56.780 --> 35:57.420
Show some respect!

35:57.420 --> 35:59.140
Respect? Why should I show you respect?

35:59.820 --> 36:00.260
Darling!

36:00.260 --> 36:01.140
Where do you think you're going?

36:01.540 --> 36:02.380
- Stay right there.
- Chunniang!

36:02.380 --> 36:02.700
Behave yourself!

36:02.700 --> 36:03.100
Chunniang!

36:03.220 --> 36:04.220
- Let go of me!
- Keep me company!

36:04.220 --> 36:04.780
- Let go!
- Darling!

36:04.780 --> 36:05.700
- Aren't I better-looking than him?
- Chunniang!

36:05.940 --> 36:07.140
- What are you doing?
- Chunhua.

36:07.140 --> 36:07.540
Let go of me!

36:07.660 --> 36:08.900
- Just have one drink with me!
- (Hold still!)

36:09.060 --> 36:09.820
- Chunniang!
- I'll make it worth your while.

36:09.820 --> 36:10.500
Chunhua!

36:10.500 --> 36:10.990
- I'll pay you.
- Let go!

36:10.990 --> 36:11.540
Chunniang!

36:12.420 --> 36:12.860
Chunniang!

36:12.860 --> 36:13.420
Darling!

36:13.420 --> 36:13.940
Chunniang!

36:13.940 --> 36:14.460
Don't move!

36:14.460 --> 36:15.060
Let me go!

36:15.370 --> 36:15.970
Chunhua!

36:17.180 --> 36:17.700
Let go!

36:19.180 --> 36:20.100
How dare you harass her!

36:20.460 --> 36:21.340
How dare you harass her!

36:21.340 --> 36:22.420
So what if I harass her?

36:23.340 --> 36:24.220
I'll do whatever I want to her!

36:24.460 --> 36:24.780
Let go!

36:24.780 --> 36:26.180
Even her own husband
doesn't dare object!

36:26.380 --> 36:27.300
Who the hell are you, you cuckold?

36:28.260 --> 36:29.500
You're her old lover, aren't you?

36:30.220 --> 36:31.060
You can't treat her like that!

36:31.380 --> 36:32.380
Leave her alone!

36:42.180 --> 36:42.740
Stop!

36:45.220 --> 36:45.740
Let go!

36:46.060 --> 36:47.140
Chunniang! Chunniang!

36:48.340 --> 36:48.900
Hold still!

36:51.020 --> 36:51.900
That's for harassing her!

36:52.100 --> 36:52.980
That's for harassing her!

36:53.180 --> 36:55.820
That's for harassing her!
Harassing her!

36:55.820 --> 36:56.860
What are you standing around for?

36:56.860 --> 36:57.580
Stop him!

36:57.740 --> 36:58.260
Stop him!

36:58.500 --> 36:58.980
Stop him!

36:59.100 --> 36:59.740
Stop him!

36:59.860 --> 37:00.540
Stop him!

37:00.540 --> 37:01.260
Let me go!

37:03.300 --> 37:03.860
Get off me!

37:09.100 --> 37:09.700
Let me go!

37:10.180 --> 37:10.740
Let her go!

37:14.100 --> 37:15.300
Hold his legs down!

37:49.940 --> 37:50.860
He's going to die!

37:50.860 --> 37:51.260
What do we do?

37:51.900 --> 37:52.700
What are we going to do?

37:52.860 --> 37:54.460
Get a doctor! Hurry!

37:54.780 --> 37:55.380
Get a doctor!

37:55.740 --> 37:56.300
I'll go! I'll go!

37:56.740 --> 37:57.100
Wake up!

37:57.820 --> 37:58.460
Poor thing!

37:58.940 --> 37:59.420
Wake up!

37:59.940 --> 38:00.620
Don't close your eyes!

38:02.060 --> 38:02.700
Don't pass out!

38:04.020 --> 38:05.060
Wake up! Come on!

38:06.940 --> 38:07.340
Wenji!

38:46.820 --> 38:47.260
Doctor,

38:47.860 --> 38:48.580
how is he?

38:50.580 --> 38:51.700
He'll survive.

38:52.780 --> 38:53.100
But

38:53.860 --> 38:54.940
he's permanently maimed.

38:56.300 --> 38:57.180
What do you mean?

38:58.260 --> 38:58.820
I mean...

39:00.020 --> 39:01.500
He can no longer function as a man.

39:04.820 --> 39:05.780
Doctor! Doctor!

39:06.260 --> 39:06.900
But my friend...

39:07.340 --> 39:08.340
Doctor! Doctor!

39:08.820 --> 39:09.940
No matter how rare the medicine,

39:10.180 --> 39:11.620
I'll find a way to get it for you!

39:12.460 --> 39:13.140
Young man,

39:13.380 --> 39:14.980
a shattered mirror can't be made whole.

39:15.420 --> 39:17.060
How can a severed part be reattached?

39:17.060 --> 39:17.420
Doctor!

39:17.700 --> 39:18.300
Please think again!

39:18.540 --> 39:19.500
Isn't there another way?

39:20.220 --> 39:20.980
- I'll do whatever I can!
- I...

39:21.820 --> 39:23.300
There's really nothing I can do!

39:23.300 --> 39:24.700
Doctor, please examine him again!

39:25.140 --> 39:26.020
You haven't even prescribed anything!

39:26.220 --> 39:27.100
How can you be sure
without even trying?

39:28.060 --> 39:28.620
Young man,

39:29.020 --> 39:30.540
please don't make this harder for me.

39:31.140 --> 39:32.780
It's not that I refuse
to prescribe medicine.

39:33.180 --> 39:33.500
It's...

39:33.860 --> 39:35.980
His injury is beyond the reach
of medicine.

39:36.660 --> 39:37.860
The severed part is destroyed.

39:38.100 --> 39:39.220
It cannot be reattached.

39:39.220 --> 39:39.500
But he's...

39:40.620 --> 39:41.620
He's still so young!

39:42.020 --> 39:42.740
He's not even married!

39:42.940 --> 39:44.220
How will he live the rest of his life?

39:44.580 --> 39:44.820
Well...

39:44.980 --> 39:45.500
Doctor,

39:46.180 --> 39:47.700
I'm begging you,
please take another look!

39:48.100 --> 39:48.700
Young man,

39:48.940 --> 39:50.020
if you truly care about him,

39:50.220 --> 39:51.420
help him come to terms with it.

39:51.500 --> 39:51.780
Doctor!

39:51.780 --> 39:52.940
- At least he lives, with a future.
- Please!

39:52.940 --> 39:53.980
There must be another way!

39:54.020 --> 39:54.500
Please think!

39:54.500 --> 39:55.980
Please stop pressing me!

39:57.820 --> 39:58.300
Wenji!

39:58.980 --> 39:59.420
Wenji!

39:59.900 --> 40:00.340
Wenji!

40:01.500 --> 40:01.900
Give it to me!

40:03.500 --> 40:04.060
Let go!

40:04.460 --> 40:05.700
Wenji, give it to me!

40:07.460 --> 40:07.980
Let go!

40:11.820 --> 40:12.300
Yan Shang.

40:13.620 --> 40:14.380
Let me die.

40:14.780 --> 40:15.220
Let go.

40:25.140 --> 40:25.620
Yan Shang.

40:26.940 --> 40:28.220
Why won't you let me die?

40:28.700 --> 40:30.260
Why won't you just let me die?

40:30.780 --> 40:32.140
Why did you save me?

40:32.260 --> 40:34.020
Why did you save me?

40:34.220 --> 40:34.620
You're right!

40:35.300 --> 40:36.260
I shouldn't have saved you!

40:37.860 --> 40:38.900
You've turned the Liu Wenji,
the man you used to be,

40:39.300 --> 40:40.580
into a pathetic wreck!

40:41.020 --> 40:42.220
I might as well kill you myself!

40:45.100 --> 40:47.180
The man I used to be...

40:50.620 --> 40:52.980
The man I used to be...

40:54.580 --> 40:56.860
The man I used to be...

41:07.900 --> 41:09.740
The man I used to be...

41:15.060 --> 41:16.620
The man I used to be...

41:23.500 --> 41:25.060
The man I used to be...

41:38.060 --> 41:39.100
The Liu Wenji I knew,

41:40.700 --> 41:41.900
the fourteenth son
of the Liu family from Lingnan,

41:43.020 --> 41:43.820
was clever

41:44.940 --> 41:45.660
and easygoing.

41:47.460 --> 41:49.060
Even when life dealt him a setback,

41:50.140 --> 41:51.100
he might lose his temper

41:52.180 --> 41:53.420
and make me want to punch him.

41:56.180 --> 41:57.060
But in the end,

41:57.820 --> 41:59.140
he'd always come to me and say,

42:01.580 --> 42:02.180
"I'm sorry."

42:06.420 --> 42:09.100
That Liu Wenji is already dead.

42:16.300 --> 42:17.100
How can he be dead?

42:18.380 --> 42:19.420
When I was imprisoned
at the Investigation Office,

42:20.380 --> 42:22.100
he did everything he could to save me.

42:24.140 --> 42:25.500
I haven't even repaid his kindness.

42:27.020 --> 42:28.060
How dare he die now

42:29.340 --> 42:30.260
and leave me forever in his debt?

42:39.780 --> 42:41.820
But I'm a broken man now.

42:44.900 --> 42:46.900
Why would you still want me as a friend?

42:50.260 --> 42:51.220
I'll treat you

42:52.700 --> 42:53.780
the way you've always treated me.

42:54.660 --> 42:56.020
No matter what happens,

42:58.540 --> 42:59.700
you'll always be my friend.

43:02.260 --> 43:02.980
Wenji.

43:11.900 --> 43:12.340
Shang.

43:16.100 --> 43:17.340
If you're truly my friend,

43:20.980 --> 43:22.300
then let me end my suffering.

43:31.820 --> 43:32.700
There's nothing left

43:34.700 --> 43:36.460
worth living for.

43:48.580 --> 43:49.140
If I told you

43:50.980 --> 43:52.140
I understand how you feel,

43:53.220 --> 43:54.020
you might not believe me.

43:57.900 --> 43:58.860
But in this world,

44:00.380 --> 44:02.220
many people suffer so much

44:03.900 --> 44:05.540
that death seems preferable,
yet they keep living,

44:07.380 --> 44:08.740
just to see how things turn out.

44:12.140 --> 44:13.540
What future could I possibly have?

44:23.540 --> 44:24.500
Are you really willing

44:26.500 --> 44:27.340
to let it end like this?

44:28.580 --> 44:30.380
What choice do I have?

44:34.140 --> 44:35.540
Look at me now!

44:36.980 --> 44:39.700
I'm neither man nor woman!

44:40.060 --> 44:41.740
I'm ruined!

44:43.780 --> 44:46.180
I can never take the imperial exams
again.

44:47.260 --> 44:50.380
I'll never be able to love anyone again!

44:54.740 --> 44:55.340
Yan Shang,

44:57.060 --> 44:59.300
there's no path left for me.

45:09.540 --> 45:09.980
Wenji,

45:12.740 --> 45:14.460
if you can't live for hope,

45:16.260 --> 45:16.700
then

45:19.580 --> 45:21.180
live for what you refuse to let go of.

45:30.300 --> 45:31.860
The man who did this to you...

45:33.140 --> 45:34.300
Do you know who he is?

45:37.060 --> 45:37.620
Are you

45:38.860 --> 45:41.660
really going to let him
get away with this?

45:47.980 --> 45:52.700
(Next Episode Preview)

45:52.820 --> 45:53.380
This family

45:53.820 --> 45:54.500
can't be brought down

45:54.500 --> 45:56.220
by some low-ranking official

45:56.340 --> 45:57.140
like you.

45:57.540 --> 45:58.620
Do I need to do it myself?

45:59.220 --> 46:02.140
Fierce tigers will devour
jackals like Zhang Jun.

46:02.380 --> 46:03.940
The tiger powerful enough
to destroy the Zhang family...

46:04.780 --> 46:05.700
In all of Sheng'an,

46:06.340 --> 46:07.260
only one family fits the bill.

46:11.840 --> 46:15.133
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

46:17.818 --> 46:22.734
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

46:24.928 --> 46:30.773
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

46:31.273 --> 46:36.499
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

46:39.268 --> 46:44.059
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

46:44.895 --> 46:50.974
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

46:52.775 --> 46:55.925
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

46:55.925 --> 46:57.573
♪Burning bright as a song♪

46:57.625 --> 47:01.349
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

47:01.727 --> 47:06.393
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

47:07.012 --> 47:11.053
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

47:11.544 --> 47:13.659
♪Not a single hour less♪

47:13.699 --> 47:20.645
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

47:21.408 --> 47:24.861
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

47:25.041 --> 47:28.186
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

47:28.625 --> 47:35.262
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

47:35.659 --> 47:37.697
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

47:37.697 --> 47:40.173
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

47:40.211 --> 47:42.680
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:42.884 --> 47:49.771
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

47:50.083 --> 47:53.354
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

47:53.659 --> 47:56.832
♪My last untouched innocence♪

47:57.156 --> 48:00.582
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

48:00.815 --> 48:04.040
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

48:04.371 --> 48:11.167
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

48:11.536 --> 48:13.598
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

48:13.599 --> 48:16.102
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

48:16.149 --> 48:18.487
♪You're the only one I need♪

48:18.718 --> 48:25.553
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

48:25.902 --> 48:27.520
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

48:27.650 --> 48:29.446
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

48:29.803 --> 48:32.820
♪You're the only one I need♪

48:32.860 --> 48:34.187
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
